; claude: a 3D modeller's scene (Blender, 1994-): objects as primitives
; placed by location, rotation and scale, Boolean modifiers, their
; wireframes (Modeler), and the four views -- three orthographic, one
; through the camera -- and picking in them (Modeler_view). Used by
; TinyBlender, which renders it with the Povray way. In the package
; tiny_appkits, as tiny_appkits.appkit_modeler: pure OCaml.
(library
 (name appkit_modeler)
 (public_name tiny_appkits.appkit_modeler)
 (wrapped false)
 (libraries
   graphics_3d_geometry ; Camera, the ray tracer's own projection
 )
)
